---
// Thank you section for the homepage explaining the shutdown
---

<section class="bg-tuhura-green py-16 md:py-20">
	<div class="container-custom">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
			<h2 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold text-white md:text-5xl">Thank You</h2>
			<p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white">
				From 2021 to 2026, Tūhura Tech worked tirelessly to bring free, high-quality technology
				education to rangatahi across Greater Wellington. This journey wouldn't have been possible
				without the incredible support of our community, kaiako, volunteers, whānau, and funders.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-10 rounded-lg bg-white p-8">
				<p class="mb-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
					<strong class="text-lg text-tuhura-green">Navigating the Funding Landscape:</strong>
					Despite our passion and impact, the difficult funding environment made it impossible to
					sustain our operations. Tech education charities across Aotearoa face significant challenges
					in securing long-term, reliable funding—a systemic issue that extends far beyond Tūhura Tech.
				</p>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
					We remain incredibly proud of what we accomplished and grateful for every rangatahi we
					supported. If the funding landscape evolves, we may return to continue our important mahi.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
